      <div class="faq-list">
        <details><summary>What is SeniorAmerica®?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">SeniorAmerica® is America's Senior Care Platform. The SeniorAmerica® App connects Seniors with trusted &amp; verified Care Givers for on-demand care, and our advisors help families find Senior Living, Assisted Living and Memory Care communities.</div></details>
        <details><summary>How much does Find Senior Living cost?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">Nothing. It is a personalized service, at zero cost to you.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Are Care Givers verified?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">Yes. Each Care Giver goes through a criminal background check.</div></details>
        <details><summary>What services can I book?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">Companionship, Personal Care, Housekeeping, Transportation &amp; Technology Support.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need a contract?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">No. Augment your current care or order new care. No contracts or commitments.</div></details>
        <details><summary>How do Care Givers get paid?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">Instantly. You don't have to wait weeks to get paid.</div></details>
        <details><summary>Which app should I download?<i><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></i></summary><div class="a">Seniors and their families use the SeniorAmerica® App. Care Givers use the CareGiver SeniorAmerica® App.</div></details>
      </div>
